<title>UK: Luebecker Hypo sets 110 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Luebecker Hypo sets 110 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LUEBECKER HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    110 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.125    MATURITY   **0.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  100.00    PAY DATE   S-0.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING ***HAMBURG   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO 20.MAR.98 THEN STEPS-UP TO 5.05 PCT.</p>
<p>	     **CALLABE AT PAR ON 20.MAR.98.</p>
<p>	    ***LISTED ONLY AFTER CALL DATE.</p>
<p>		 S-SHORT FIRST COUPON.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
